<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
  <title>Help & FAQ</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/styles.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/usps-theme.css" />
<body>
  <header class="site-header">
    <div class="container header-bar">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/my-logo.png" alt="Logo" class="brand-logo" />
      </a>
      <nav>
        <a href="/">Home</a>
        <a href="/track">Track</a>
        <a href="/track-multiple">Multiple Tracking</a>
        <a href="/rates">Rates</a>
        <a href="/help" class="active">Help</a>
      </nav>
    </div>
  </header>

<main class="container">
  <section class="card">
    <h2>Help & Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h3>Tracking Your Package</h3>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>How do I track my package?</h4>
      <p>Enter your tracking number on the home page or use the Track Multiple page to check several packages at once.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>What do the tracking statuses mean?</h4>
      <ul>
        <li><strong>Accepted:</strong> Package has been picked up</li>
        <li><strong>In Transit:</strong> Package is moving through our network</li>
        <li><strong>Out for Delivery:</strong> Package is on the delivery vehicle</li>
        <li><strong>Delivered:</strong> Package has been delivered</li>
        <li><strong>Delivery Failed:</strong> Delivery was attempted but unsuccessful</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h3>Delivery Options</h3>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>Can I change my delivery address?</h4>
      <p>Contact support with your tracking number to request address changes before the package is out for delivery.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>What if I miss my delivery?</h4>
      <p>If delivery fails, you can schedule a redelivery or choose to hold the package at a nearby location for pickup.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>How do I set delivery preferences?</h4>
      <p>From your tracking page, click "Delivery Preferences" to set instructions, safe place locations, or request signature confirmation.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h3>Shipping & Rates</h3>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>How are shipping rates calculated?</h4>
      <p>Rates are based on package weight and distance. Use our Rates Calculator to get an estimate before shipping.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>What is the maximum weight for packages?</h4>
      <p>We accept packages up to 70 kg. Contact us for heavier shipments requiring special handling.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h3>Claims & Issues</h3>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>What if my package is lost or damaged?</h4>
      <p>Visit our <a href="/support">Support & Claims</a> page to file a claim. You'll need your tracking number and description of the issue.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="faq-item">
      <h4>How long do I have to file a claim?</h4>
      <p>Claims must be filed within 60 days of the shipment date.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="card">
    <h3>Contact Us</h3>
    <p>Need more help? Visit our <a href="/support">Support page</a> or find a <a href="/locations">location near you</a>.</p>
  </section>
</main>

<footer class="site-footer">
  <div class="container">© ParcelTrack</div>
</footer>
</body>
</html>
